A definition body continuation indented past its column is lazy text

```
:: t
:  body
    > q
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>body
&gt; q</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
:  body
   > q
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>body</p>
    <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
:  body
> q
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>body</dd>
</dl>
<blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
```
